Besides a major feature rollout that expands live progress updates to step 3, this PR introduces a couple of other enhancements:

- Allow a user to decide on saving or deleting cache file and if saving, provides him with an option to rename the file;
- Give users the option to rename generated trajectory file and map-matching file at download;
- Display generation statistics and the pickle file used if a user uploads a pickle file at step 2;

This PR contains changes from PR(s): #9237
`main` will be fast-forwarded to the HEAD of this PR when CI passes,  and the original PR(s) will be closed.



